    "summary": "Hakgrym the Howler is a Nord and a lieutenant of the Draugrkin. He acts as the first boss of Unhallowed Grave and is accompanied by two Skeletal Werewolves and flesh abominations at the beginning of battle. During the fight he will reveal himself to be a werewolf behemoth once the odds go against him.",
